#X text 700 340 2026-08-10 debug taps -- SETNAME-IN = raw route match before the re-prepend -- confirms this object's own route for set_track_name actually matched what gnumbat-analyze.pd sent it. SETNAME-OUT = final message this object hands to bridge_sliceWriter's inlet (outlet 0). Case A: IN fires but OUT doesn't -- the re-prepend object is the break. Case B: neither fires -- the break is upstream in gnumbat-analyze.pd or bridge_analyzeReader.pd. Case C: OUT fires but bridge_sliceWriter's SW-TRACKNAME tap still doesn't -- the break is the patch cord into bridge_sliceWriter or that bridge itself.;
